    "description": "This stylish 1-bedroom, 2-bath loft condo located at the center of San Francisco\u2019s most exciting neighborhood is merely steps away from Oracle Park, Embarcadero, and Chase Center. Whether you're a sports fan, concert-goer, or city explorer, this home puts you right where the action is.  With soaring ceilings, oversized windows, concrete floors, and an open layout, this bright and airy loft blends industrial chic with modern comfort. The spacious living area with a balcony & fireplace and an open dining space are great for entertaining, while the lofted bedroom offers a private retreat above it all. Enjoy the convenience of 2 full bathrooms, ideal for hosting guests or creating separate work/live zones. The sleek kitchen features stainless steel appliances, granite countertops, & a breakfast bar. The shared rooftop deck with panoramic city views is perfect for gatherings with friends.  One-car garage parking, in-unit washer & dryer, and a storage unit complete the package. Caltrain, access to Hwy 280, public transit are just blocks away. You're surrounded by world-class dining, shopping, and nightlife. A perfect spot to unwind or enjoy city life!"
  },
